{"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"A circular indicator shows the progress of a task using a circle.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It can show a specific value (determinate) or just that something is in progress (indeterminate).","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Useful when you need more visual focus or when space is limited.","type":"text"}],"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Initializers","anchor":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator\/init(progress:status:track:gapSize:animated:size:helperText:accessibility:)","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator\/init(status:track:gapSize:size:helperText:accessibility:)"]},{"generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties","anchor":"Instance-Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator\/body"]},{"generated":true,"title":"Type Properties","anchor":"Type-Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator\/defaultSize"]},{"generated":true,"title":"Enumerations","anchor":"Enumerations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator\/HelperTextType"]},{"generated":true,"title":"Default Implementations","anchor":"Default-Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator\/View-Implementations","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator\/View-Implementations"]}],"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSCircularProgressIndicator","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSCircularProgressIndicator","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","title":"OUDSCircularProgressIndicator","symbolKind":"struct","roleHeading":"Structure","platforms":[{"beta":false,"name":"iOS","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"15.0"},{"beta":false,"name":"macOS","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"13.0"},{"beta":false,"name":"tvOS","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"16.0"},{"beta":false,"name":"visionOS","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"1.0"},{"beta":false,"name":"watchOS","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"11.0"}],"externalID":"s:14OUDSComponents29OUDSCircularProgressIndicatorV"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudscircularprogressindicator"]}],"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSCircularProgressIndicator","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/Indicators"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Variants","text":"Variants","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Two variants are provided:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Determinate"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": the caller provides a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"progress"},{"type":"text","text":" value in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"[0, 1]"},{"type":"text","text":". Values outside this range are coerced."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Shows the exact progress of a task, usually as a percentage from 0% to 100%."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Provides clear and measurable feedback, helping users understand how long the task will take and reducing uncertainty."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Use determinate indicators whenever possible. Avoid indeterminate when progress can be measured, e.g."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when the progress value is known (e.g. file upload, installation, data sync) or when the system can estimate completion time or percentage"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Indeterminate"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": no "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"progress"},{"type":"text","text":" is provided and the indicator loops continuously."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Shows that a process is active without indicating exact progress."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Used when the system cannot determine how long the task will take."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Communicates that the system is working, even without precise data, and prevents users from thinking the interface is frozen."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For long loading times (over 5 seconds), additional context must be provided."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This helps inform users about the system state, reduces uncertainty, and prevents the interface from being perceived as unresponsive."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"anchor":"Statuses","text":"Statuses","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Neutral"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": default status used when progress has no specific semantic meaning. Suitable for generic loading,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"processing, synchronization or background tasks."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Accent"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": used to highlight primary or brand-related actions (uploads, downloads, installations, onboarding)."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Positive"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": indicates successful progress or a process leading to a successful outcome."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Info"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": indicates informational or system-related processes (background synchronization, data retrieval)."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Warning"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": indicates progress related to an operation that requires user attention or should be monitored."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Negative"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": indicates progress related to an error, recovery, cancellation or failure."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"anchor":"Gap-size","text":"Gap size","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"default"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": standard gap between the indicator and the track (about 14° of arc)."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"small"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": reduced gap for a more compact appearance."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"anchor":"Track","text":"Track","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":" (default): the track is displayed. Recommended when the indicator is shown on its own and needs a clear"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"structure. The track helps define the full range of progress and makes the value easier to read."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"type":"text","text":": the track is hidden. Recommended when the indicator is embedded inside another component"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(button, tag, toast) or when a more minimal appearance is needed."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"anchor":"Animation-determinate-mode-only","text":"Animation (determinate mode only)","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"When ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"animated"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"text":" (default), the determinate indicator progressively fills from ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0"},{"text":" to the target","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"progress"},{"text":" on first display, and animates any subsequent change of ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"progress"},{"text":". When ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"animated"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the indicator is displayed instantly at its target value with no animation.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Animations are always disabled when ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"accessibilityReduceMotion"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"text":" or when Low Power Mode is enabled,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"regardless of the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"animated"},{"text":" flag.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The indeterminate mode is not affected by this flag: its Android Material 3 animation is intrinsic to the mode.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Helper-text","text":"Helper text","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"An optional text displayed below the circular indicator to provide context or additional information.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The helper text is always centered under the indicator.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"determinate"}]},{"text":" mode, use ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator\/HelperTextType"},{"text":" which offers two variants:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".description(_:)"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": Displays a simple description text without the progress percentage."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".percent(_:)"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": Displays the progress percentage with an optional description. The percentage"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"value and its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"%"},{"type":"text","text":" symbol are assembled through the localized wording key"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"core_progressIndicator_percent_value"},{"type":"text","text":", so the symbol, its spacing and its position follow the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"typographic rules of the current language (e.g. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"75%\""},{"type":"text","text":" in English, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"75 %\""},{"type":"text","text":" in French, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"٪75\""},{"type":"text","text":" in Arabic)."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"indeterminate"}]},{"text":" mode, the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"helperText"},{"text":" parameter is a simple ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"String?"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Code-samples","text":"Code samples","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"code":["    \/\/ Determinate - default (neutral, with track, default gap, reveal animation on display)","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75)","","    \/\/ Determinate with an accent status and no track","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator(progress: 0.5, status: .accent, track: false)","","    \/\/ Determinate with a warning status and a small gap","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator(progress: 0.3, status: .warning, gapSize: .small)","","    \/\/ Determinate displayed instantly at its target value, without any animation","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75, animated: false)","","    \/\/ Determinate with helper text","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75, helperText: .description(\"Uploading...\"))","","    \/\/ Determinate with percentage and description","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75,","                                  helperText: .percent(\"of 100 MB\"))","","    \/\/ Determinate with accessibility name and state for VoiceOver","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75,","                                  accessibility: .init(name: \"download bar\", state: \"downloading\"))","","    \/\/ Determinate with accessibility and helper text","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator(progress: 0.5,","                                  accessibility: .init(name: \"progress bar\", state: \"step 1 of 4\"),","                                  helperText: .description(\"Loading...\"))","","    \/\/ Indeterminate","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator()","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator(status: .info)","","    \/\/ Indeterminate with helper text","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator(status: .info, helperText: \"Processing...\")"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"anchor":"Accessibility-considerations","text":"Accessibility considerations","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"accessibility"},{"type":"text","text":" parameter to provide a custom name and state for VoiceOver:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"accessibility.name"},{"text":": The name of the component (e.g., “progress bar”, “download bar”)","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"accessibility.state"},{"text":": The state of the component (e.g., “downloading”, “step 1 of 4”)","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"VoiceOver reads: "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"[name]. [state]. [helperText] [value]"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":". Example: "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"“download bar. downloading. 75 percent”"}],"type":"emphasis"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"accessibility"},{"type":"text","text":" is not provided, the behavior is unchanged: only the helper text (if provided) is used as label."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"determinate"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" mode, the view exposes the current progress as an accessibility value (percentage) so that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"VoiceOver reads e.g. "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"“75 percent”"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":", and is marked with the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".updatesFrequently"},{"type":"text","text":" trait so that assistive"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"technologies know the value is changing."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The indicator never captures "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Full Keyboard Access"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" focus, as no interaction is possible on a progress"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"indicator. On iOS 17+ \/ macOS 14+ \/ visionOS 1+ \/ watchOS 10+ \/ tvOS 17+, this is enforced via"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"accessibilityRespondsToUserInteraction(false)"},{"type":"text","text":"; on earlier OS versions, the semantic "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".isStaticText"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"trait is used."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"indeterminate"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" mode, the view is hidden from VoiceOver ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".accessibilityHidden(true)"},{"type":"text","text":") — and therefore"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"also excluded from Full Keyboard Access navigation: there is no readable value to expose and keeping the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"element focusable would only pollute navigation."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Animations are disabled when "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"accessibilityReduceMotion"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":" or when Low Power Mode is enabled."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"anchor":"Colored-surfaces","text":"Colored surfaces","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"When placed on an ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSColoredSurface"},{"text":", the indicator switches to a ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"monochrome"}]},{"text":" rendering, the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"status"},{"text":" is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"ignored.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Design-documentation","text":"Design documentation","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/unified-design-system.orange.com"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Themes-rendering","text":"Themes rendering","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"anchor":"Orange","text":"Orange","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_progress_indicator_circular_Orange"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Orange-Compact","text":"Orange Compact","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_progress_indicator_circular_OrangeCompact"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Sosh","text":"Sosh","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_progress_indicator_circular_Sosh"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Wireframe","text":"Wireframe","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_progress_indicator_circular_Wireframe"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"1.2.0 (Figma component design version)"}]}],"type":"aside","name":"Version"},{"style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"3.0.0"}]}],"type":"aside","name":"Since"}]}],"references":{"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/Indicators":{"type":"topic","images":[{"identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png","type":"icon"},{"type":"card","identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png"}],"role":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Some components can be used for "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"indicators","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/indicators","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/Indicators","kind":"article","title":"Indicators"},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator/View-Implementations":{"kind":"article","url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudscircularprogressindicator\/view-implementations","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator\/View-Implementations","abstract":[],"type":"topic","role":"collectionGroup","title":"View Implementations"},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator/body":{"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudscircularprogressindicator\/body","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator\/body","title":"body","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"body"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"View","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://OUDSComponents/s8SendableP":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s8SendableP","title":"Swift.Sendable","type":"unresolvable"},"component_progress_indicator_circular_OrangeCompact":{"variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_progress_indicator_circular_OrangeCompact.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"identifier":"component_progress_indicator_circular